# Stage 4b: z-direction density equilibration, substrate + lateral (x,y)
# box fixed. x,y are never barostatted (no x/y keyword below) so the box
# stays commensurate with the substrate's lattice throughout, the same
# constraint GROMACS's own npt_semiiso.mdp respects in step2_dilute.smk.
#
# `fix press/berendsen`, NOT `fix npt`/Nose-Hoover -- confirmed live
# 2026-11-08 by direct comparison on this exact system (ST's
# merged.data): `fix npt mobile npt ... z 1.0 1.0 1000.0 dilate mobile`
# never converges here at all, not even to a self-consistent non-literal
# target -- temperature ran away to a stable-but-wrong ~465 K plateau and
# pressure to ~137,000 atm regardless of whether the target was a
# literal 1 atm or the system's own pre-barostat pressure reading
# (~19,375 atm); the frozen substrate's own enormous internal ionic
# virial (E_coul ~ -1.4e6 kcal/mol) swamps the only lever the barostat
# has (the liquid's own volume), and Nose-Hoover's extended-Lagrangian
# inertia turns that irreducible mismatch into a runaway heating
# feedback loop. `fix press/berendsen` (no inertia, a direct per-step
# volume rescale toward the target) does NOT have this failure mode:
# with the SAME literal 1 atm target it reached a genuinely stable 300 K
# / ~133,700 atm steady state and its z-length contracted from 109.33 to
# 100.87 A within 0.5 ps and then held flat for the rest of a 10 ps test
# run -- an 8.46 A contraction matching almost exactly the 8.45 A the
# real 10 ns flow2-ai production run slowly drifted toward under passive
# fixed-volume NVT. Found by example in the sibling
# ../2026-10-28-generate-aa-pama repo's
# in/335_polymer_in_solvent_on_substrate_npt/npt.lmp.template, which
# barostats a similarly substrate-adjacent liquid this same way (its own
# `dilate partial` -- a literal value, not a group-ID, specific to
# `press/berendsen`'s keyword syntax and different from `fix npt`'s
# `dilate <group-ID>`, confirmed live 2026-11-08 the two are not
# interchangeable) with `barostat_damping: 25000` (fs) and `modulus:
# 10000` (atm, a plausible bulk modulus for a simple alkane liquid) --
# reused here unchanged rather than re-tuned from scratch.
#
# `press/berendsen` only rescales volume, it has no thermostat of its
# own (unlike `fix npt`) -- a separate `fix nvt` controls temperature.
{% include "_common_setup.lmp.template" %}

thermo 500
thermo_style custom step c_mobtemp c_mobpress pe evdwl ecoul elong

fix npt_z_temp mobile nvt temp {{ params.temperature_K }} {{ params.temperature_K }} 100.0
fix npt_z mobile press/berendsen z {{ params.pressure_atm }} {{ params.pressure_atm }} &
    {{ params.pressure_damp_fs }} modulus {{ params.modulus_atm }} dilate partial

run {{ params.npt_z_nsteps }}

unfix npt_z
unfix npt_z_temp

write_data npt_equilibrated.data
write_restart npt_equilibrated.restart
